  "body": "Privately positioned in a sheltered, north-facing setting, this beautifully presented French-inspired home combines timeless character, abundant sunshine and an enviable coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nBathed in natural light, the open-plan kitchen and dining area, together with the additional living spaces, flow effortlessly to patios, decking and beautifully landscaped gardens, creating an inviting environment for relaxed everyday living and entertaining. Three bedrooms and three bathrooms, including two ensuites, provide excellent flexibility and convenience, while the thoughtfully established outdoor spaces offer a private retreat to enjoy throughout the seasons.\r\n\r\nA short stroll down the stairs conveniently located near the end of the driveway brings you to beautiful St Leonards Beach and a secluded stretch of coastline, perfect for a morning swim or a relaxing afternoon by the ocean.\r\n\r\nWith an internal-access double garage, generous off-street parking and excellent storage, there’s ample room for vehicles, visitors and all the essentials of coastal living. The home combines practical functionality with an enviable lifestyle.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n•Exceptional privacy in a peaceful, sheltered setting\r\n•Desirable north-facing aspect capturing all-day sunshine\r\n•Three bedrooms, two with ensuites, plus a family bathroom\r\n•Timeless French-inspired architecture and interiors\r\n•Light-filled, open-plan living and entertaining spaces\r\n•Beautifully landscaped gardens, patios and deck, ideal for outdoor dining\r\n•Convenient access to beautiful St Leonards Beach\r\n•Internal-access double garage, generous off-street parking and excellent storage\r\n•Zoned for Takapuna Grammar, Belmont Primary and Belmont Intermediate\r\n•Close to bus stops, local cafés, shops and amenities.\r\n\r\nVacant and available for immediate possession, this is an opportunity to secure your own coastal retreat and settle in before Christmas, ready to enjoy the best of summer.\r\n\r\nCombining an idyllic setting with effortless living and the coastline on your doorstep, this is a special home in one of the North Shore's most sought-after neighbourhoods.",
